  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable use of plastics and prevention of marine litter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to start the development and depolyment of an integrated approach to sustainbale plastic use and marine litter prevention for reduced environmental impact, enhanced productivity and innovation.The expected outcome of the proposed project is strengthened policy framework, improved capacity and enhanced responsibility and action of key stakeholders towards sustainable plastic use and litter prevention in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
